     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-care-entry-point-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-care-entry-point-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-care-entry-point-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-1\">care-entry-point-1</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">OPD</td><td>Source form code 1: Outpatient department.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-2\">care-entry-point-2</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Inpatients</td><td>Source form code 2: Inpatients.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-3\">care-entry-point-3</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">HTS</td><td>Source form code 3: HIV testing services.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-4\">care-entry-point-4</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">TB DOTS</td><td>Source form code 4: TB DOTS.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-5\">care-entry-point-5</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">STI Clinic</td><td>Source form code 5: STI Clinic.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs.html#ng-hiv-care-art-codes-cs-care-entry-point-6\">care-entry-point-6</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">ANC/PMTCT</td><td>Source